{
    "description": "This job script sets up a three-stage quantum espresso pipeline: an SCF ground state calculation, a DFPT phonon calculation that depends on the SCF result, and post-processing of dynamical matrices into phonon DOS and dispersion, all submitted via Slurm's sbatch with job dependencies.",
